    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d551">

                <pb facs="0676" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg574"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Wilson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-05-09"><hi rendition="#italic">May 9,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wilson’s action, reported his 329, meets with approval this Government, both
                    as to memorandum presented to minister for foreign affairs and reply regarding
                    treatment our communications as unofficial prior to decisive vote upon
                    annexation and to become official immediately thereafter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
